<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - E*Trade upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - E*Trade upgraded.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said analyst Mark Wolfenberger upgraded E*Trade Group Inc to buy from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- cited &quot;blowout&quot; fiscal third quarter 1997 resutls.</p>
<p>-- raised fiscal 1997 estimate to $0.42 a share from $0.34 and boosted fiscal 1998 to $0.55 from $0.50.</p>
